Agent Supplementary Opinion
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Honest answer to "Can continued phased buying still yield good returns?":

Insufficient basis at this point.

The structural theme (AI power infrastructure) direction itself is hard to deny.
However, continuing phased buying while the cause of the 5/15 plunge remains unclear
is behavior that relies on the confirmation bias of "the theme is right, so it will
eventually recover."
The current position is already near break-even, so opportunity cost of holding cash
is not significant.
Identifying the cause of the plunge and confirming technical direction should
take priority over resuming phased buying.
